{"video_id": "OgFf_J1CP0g", "segment_index": 0, "start_seconds": 0.0, "end_seconds": 4.199999809265137, "text": "Imagine there's a hotel with infinite rooms.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OgFf_J1CP0g", "segment_index": 1, "start_seconds": 4.199999809265137, "end_seconds": 8.279999732971191, "text": "They're numbered 1, 2, 3, 4, and so on forever.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OgFf_J1CP0g", "segment_index": 2, "start_seconds": 8.279999732971191, "end_seconds": 11.800000190734863, "text": "This is the Hilbert Hotel, and you are the manager.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OgFf_J1CP0g", "segment_index": 3, "start_seconds": 11.800000190734863, "end_seconds": 15.5, "text": "Now, it might seem like you could accommodate anyone who ever shows up,", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OgFf_J1CP0g", "segment_index": 4, "start_seconds": 15.5, "end_seconds": 17.600000381469727, "text": "but there is a limit,", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OgFf_J1CP0g", "segment_index": 5, "start_seconds": 17.600000381469727, "end_seconds": 22.100000381469727, "text": "a way to exceed even the infinity of rooms at the Hilbert Hotel.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OgFf_J1CP0g", "segment_index": 6, "start_seconds": 22.100000381469727, "end_seconds": 25.600000381469727, "text": "To start, let's say only one person is allowed in each room,", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OgFf_J1CP0g", "segment_index": 7, "start_seconds": 25.600000381469727, "end_seconds": 27.899999618530273, "text": "and all the rooms are full.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OgFf_J1CP0g", "segment_index": 8, "start_seconds": 27.899999618530273, "end_seconds": 32.20000076293945, "text": "There are an infinite number of people in an infinite number of rooms.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OgFf_J1CP0g", "segment_index": 9, "start_seconds": 32.20000076293945, "end_seconds": 35.400001525878906, "text": "Then, someone new shows up, and they want a room.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OgFf_J1CP0g", "segment_index": 10, "start_seconds": 35.400001525878906, "end_seconds": 38.099998474121094, "text": "But all the rooms are occupied, so what should you do?", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OgFf_J1CP0g", "segment_index": 11, "start_seconds": 38.099998474121094, "end_seconds": 41.70000076293945, "text": "You get on the PA, and you tell all the guests to move down a room.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OgFf_J1CP0g", "segment_index": 12, "start_seconds": 41.70000076293945, "end_seconds": 43.70000076293945, "text": "So the person in room 1 moves to room 2,", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OgFf_J1CP0g", "segment_index": 13, "start_seconds": 43.70000076293945, "end_seconds": 46.900001525878906, "text": "the one in room 2 moves to room 3, and so on down the line.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OgFf_J1CP0g", "segment_index": 14, "start_seconds": 46.900001525878906, "end_seconds": 49.5, "text": "And now, you can put the new guest in room 1.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OgFf_J1CP0g", "segment_index": 15, "start_seconds": 49.5, "end_seconds": 52.79999923706055, "text": "If a bus shows up with 100 people, you know exactly what to do.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OgFf_J1CP0g", "segment_index": 16, "start_seconds": 52.900001525878906, "end_seconds": 58.0, "text": "Just move everyone down 100 rooms, and put the new guests in their vacated rooms.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OgFf_J1CP0g", "segment_index": 17, "start_seconds": 58.0, "end_seconds": 61.20000076293945, "text": "But now, say a bus shows up that is infinitely long,", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OgFf_J1CP0g", "segment_index": 18, "start_seconds": 61.20000076293945, "end_seconds": 63.70000076293945, "text": "and it's carrying infinitely many people.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OgFf_J1CP0g", "segment_index": 19, "start_seconds": 63.70000076293945, "end_seconds": 67.5, "text": "You think about it for a minute, and then come up with a plan.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OgFf_J1CP0g", "segment_index": 20, "start_seconds": 67.5, "end_seconds": 72.5, "text": "You tell each of your existing guests to move to the room with double their room number.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OgFf_J1CP0g", "segment_index": 21, "start_seconds": 72.5, "end_seconds": 77.0, "text": "So the person in room 1 moves to room 2, room 2 moves to room 4,", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OgFf_J1CP0g", "segment_index": 22, "start_seconds": 77.0, "end_seconds": 79.80000305175781, "text": "room 3 to room 6, and so on.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OgFf_J1CP0g", "segment_index": 23, "start_seconds": 79.80000305175781, "end_seconds": 83.19999694824219, "text": "And now, all of the odd-numbered rooms are available.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OgFf_J1CP0g", "segment_index": 24, "start_seconds": 83.19999694824219, "end_seconds": 86.30000305175781, "text": "And you know there are an infinite number of odd numbers,", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OgFf_J1CP0g", "segment_index": 25, "start_seconds": 86.30000305175781, "end_seconds": 91.69999694824219, "text": "so you can give each person on the infinite bus a unique odd-numbered room.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OgFf_J1CP0g", "segment_index": 26, "start_seconds": 91.69999694824219, "end_seconds": 94.5, "text": "And then, all of a sudden, more infinite buses show up.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OgFf_J1CP0g", "segment_index": 27, "start_seconds": 94.5, "end_seconds": 99.4000015258789, "text": "Not just one or two, but an infinite number of infinite buses.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OgFf_J1CP0g", "segment_index": 28, "start_seconds": 99.4000015258789, "end_seconds": 101.19999694824219, "text": "You pull out an infinite spreadsheet.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OgFf_J1CP0g", "segment_index": 29, "start_seconds": 101.19999694824219, "end_seconds": 105.5, "text": "You make a row for each bus, bus 1, bus 2, bus 3, and so on,", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OgFf_J1CP0g", "segment_index": 30, "start_seconds": 105.5, "end_seconds": 109.0999984741211, "text": "and a row at the top for all the people who are already in the hotel.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OgFf_J1CP0g", "segment_index": 31, "start_seconds": 109.0999984741211, "end_seconds": 112.19999694824219, "text": "The columns are for the position each person occupies.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OgFf_J1CP0g", "segment_index": 32, "start_seconds": 112.19999694824219, "end_seconds": 117.0, "text": "So you've got hotel room 1, hotel room 2, hotel room 3, etc.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OgFf_J1CP0g", "segment_index": 33, "start_seconds": 117.0, "end_seconds": 122.30000305175781, "text": "And then bus 1, seat 1, bus 1, seat 2, bus 1, seat 3, and so on.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OgFf_J1CP0g", "segment_index": 34, "start_seconds": 122.30000305175781, "end_seconds": 124.5999984741211, "text": "So each person gets a unique identifier,", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OgFf_J1CP0g", "segment_index": 35, "start_seconds": 124.5999984741211, "end_seconds": 128.1999969482422, "text": "which is a combination of their vehicle and their position in it.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OgFf_J1CP0g", "segment_index": 36, "start_seconds": 128.1999969482422, "end_seconds": 130.39999389648438, "text": "So how do you assign the rooms?", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OgFf_J1CP0g", "segment_index": 37, "start_seconds": 130.39999389648438, "end_seconds": 136.6999969482422, "text": "We'll start in the top left corner and draw a line that zigzags back and forth across the spreadsheet,", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OgFf_J1CP0g", "segment_index": 38, "start_seconds": 136.6999969482422, "end_seconds": 139.89999389648438, "text": "going over each unique ID exactly once.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OgFf_J1CP0g", "segment_index": 39, "start_seconds": 139.89999389648438, "end_seconds": 145.6999969482422, "text": "Then, imagine you pull on the opposite ends of this line, straightening it out.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OgFf_J1CP0g", "segment_index": 40, "start_seconds": 145.6999969482422, "end_seconds": 151.5, "text": "So we've gone from an infinite-by-infinite grid to a single infinite line.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OgFf_J1CP0g", "segment_index": 41, "start_seconds": 151.5, "end_seconds": 157.0, "text": "It's then pretty simple just to line up each person on that line with a unique room in the hotel.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "OgFf_J1CP0g", "segment_index": 42, "start_seconds": 157.0, "end_seconds": 159.10000610351562, "text": "So everyone fits, no problem.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
